        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUlTdp4JUoJSFixdzjblzfnPgvf\"><em><strong>The maps below show a town centre in 1990 and the same town centre today. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant</strong>.</em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Town Centre Maps: 1990 vs Today</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FTHXdwGZBoTrVRxCaPwlRMLJgtg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Town Centre Maps: 1990 vs Today y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về bố cục của<strong> </strong>trung t&acirc;m một thị trấn v&agrave;o năm 1990 v&agrave; hiện tại.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GSzpdaqMgorTNOxuv5qlXq0fgfd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Town Centre Maps: 1990 vs Today với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: <strong>trung t&acirc;m thị trấn - thay đổi - 1990 v&agrave; hiện tại</strong>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(79, 84, 100);\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GDOVdo9luowv8exQULKlNmHkglc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EedTdEdGBoyrCQxa8IllnmqdgJb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Một shopping mall lớn thay thế c&aacute;c shop nhỏ</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HHgKdcHbZobZGtxX1X7lVvckgne\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Residential houses biến th&agrave;nh apartment blocks</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N5vXdKy7poz0MHxrMBTlnynJgdf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Xuất hiện th&ecirc;m pedestrian crossings</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EMF5dIYjBoePKXx534QlooO1gNg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c sự thay đổi dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; <strong>về mặt địa l&yacute;</strong>:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HvBidqc36onHU2xu73Wl00RPgZb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HvBidqc36onHU2xu73Wl00RPgZb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> C&aacute;c thay đổi ở ph&iacute;a Bắc</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E9J4dzEPVoeQbUxsRFKl9vfRgYg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F9PodlYGEoKz6qxCcnjlrxmKgKc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả trung t&acirc;m thị trấn v&agrave;o năm 1990:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FTnyddDASoaEpfxK2RbltQBMg8e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nhiều <strong>shop</strong> nhỏ v&agrave; <strong>childcare center</strong> v&agrave; 2<strong> banks</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ILK4dhWOdo71lbxiVEjlNpl9gxh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả thay đổi hiện tại:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CtRXdIPkUo4essxfe27lNkOFgVf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C&aacute;c <strong>shop</strong> nhỏ được gộp lại th&agrave;nh một <strong>shopping mall</strong> lớn</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dgpxd4Eq9oglYdxSat7l5AMXgvc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Childcare cente</strong>r kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZnmAdo4NJom1D7xAJbfluhpzgvi\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Bank</strong> tr&ecirc;n <strong>Oldfield Street</strong> đổi th&agrave;nh qu&aacute;n <strong>cafe </strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lw1ydrlIioXSK1xYJMSll2AGg5c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lw1ydrlIioXSK1xYJMSll2AGg5c\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: C&aacute;c thay đổi ở ph&iacute;a Nam</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wb4FdCXHpoN9CFxERiclOP4ugcg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XJjydpSRLoy5CFxCsGqldhvFgbh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả trung t&acirc;m thị trấn v&agrave;o năm 1990:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ItfrdOk89oDHByxWGABlKuZigSe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C&oacute; <strong>houses</strong> dọc <strong>Green Street</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hr8IdycjuoWDTYxiDa8lvJBQgBX\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Park, library v&agrave; town hall</strong> ở giữa trung t&acirc;m</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ws9rdLhI0oatJQxjKfRlNyp0ggh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả thay đổi hiện tại:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V0mhddNSfoyieEx4pVmlod8sgXf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Houses </strong>được thay thế bởi <strong>apartment blocks</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QSXWdo3OwoqDvZxE8MQl8gingzb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C&aacute;c <strong>địa điểm c&ograve;n lại</strong> giữ nguy&ecirc;n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZdvDdYagOo2djdxL8tIl6vJpgph\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C&oacute; th&ecirc;m<strong> pedestrian crossings</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NxZWd82hvoXHvjx3D2ZlpE96gYd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" d