          {
            "id": 524,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WSLedGJ9nox2uCxCDnplMqzYgwe\">Overall, the most significant changes include the replacement of individual shops with a large shopping mall and the transformation of residential houses into apartment blocks with the addition of pedestrian crossings.</div>\n</div>",
