            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 525,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K5BldeKexo1o3hx06xllmae5gGb\">In 1990, the northern side of Smith Street contained a row of individual shops including a newsagent's, grocer's, baker's, butcher's, and cafe, along with a childcare centre and two banks. Today, all these individual shops have been consolidated into a single shopping mall, while the childcare centre remains unchanged. In addition, one of the banks on Oldfield Street has been converted into a cafe.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13818,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 526,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Di4idvfNUoyoQxxMFL4lO552gZG\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I6TAdPKymoXPXUxAjNQlnPtogpf\">Turning to the southern section, it featured a row of houses along Green Street, with a park, library, and town hall in the middle of the town centre in 1990. However, the houses have now been replaced by modern apartment blocks, while the remaining locations maintain their original positions. The area has become more pedestrian-oriented with the addition of zebra crossings on both Green Street and Oldfield Street.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
